WEBVTT

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:39.240
Amazing!

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:43.570
Her maximum range is up by 10%, and her accuracy is at 98%.

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:45.940
She's almost perfect.

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.110
She'll finally be of some use now.

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:51.640
Send her home for today.

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:55.080
She says she wants to keep going.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.060
Tell her to hold back a bit.

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:18.480
I feel like it'll disappear...

00:01:18.310 --> 00:01:24.210
...the instant I look away.

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:29.350
I just kept counting...

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:34.790
...all the many traces of loneliness...

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:42.160
...that I'd vomited up.

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:48.100
In this time that seems so dry,

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:53.210
...my heart is thrashing around and drowning.

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:59.070
It takes those lies that make my head spin...

00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:02.120
...and tears them to pieces.

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:11.790
 And the place I lose my way in...

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:19.620
...is a dim, hazy world.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.860
I thought it would be enough...

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:01.370
What should I do...?

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:13.520
You came along in the nick of time.

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:15.420
Glad to be of service.

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:18.050
It takes over an hour to get to town from there,

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:21.060
...and it's dangerous for a girl to be walking around there all alone.

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:23.630
There's a lot of scary stuff going on nowadays.

00:03:24.130 --> 00:03:25.120
Is that so?

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:29.230
There are a lot of kids nowadays that are like you.

00:03:30.470 --> 00:03:32.300
I'm on my way to give a good scolding...

00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:35.170
...to a strange girl who didn't call to say she wasn't coming in.

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:39.940
If she doesn't feel like working, why doesn't she just quit?

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:44.510
Geez, kids nowadays...

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:48.890
Work is proof to society that you exist.

00:03:48.890 --> 00:03:54.490
Life isn't fun at all unless you work as hard as you can to be recognized by someone.

00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:56.220
I can understand that.

00:03:58.030 --> 00:04:00.060
Did I say something strange?

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:05.900
I'm sorry, but I didn't think that you and I would see eye to eye on anything.

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:12.380
Thank you very much.

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:13.910
Oh, wait a minute.

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:16.320
Here, use this.

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:18.490
It's right over there.

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:19.650
It's all right.

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:23.260
I'll give you my business card, so you can return it whenever.

00:04:25.190 --> 00:04:27.720
In that case, if you'll excuse me...

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:44.850
Eiko Yano, huh?

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:54.250
I've got no energy... I ditched work again today.

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:56.860
I bet I'm gonna get scolded again.

00:04:56.860 --> 00:04:58.830
You have nothing to worry about, Chie.

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:04.160
If anyone ever harasses you, I'll make them pay.

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:07.060
Thank you, l...

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.410
What's the big idea?

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:25.380
You were absent without leave! This is the second time this month!

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:27.380
I know...

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:30.830
Are you sick or something?

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:31.690
No...

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:34.500
It's boring.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.300
What is?

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:38.130
I only get assigned the boring stuff.

00:05:38.130 --> 00:05:39.970
You're putting the cart before the horse there.

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:43.130
If you do a good job with what you're given, I'll trust you with work suited to you.

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:48.940
Hey, stop that!

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:53.880
Why are you doing the dishes while I'm talking to you?!

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:57.150
I thought it would be rude if they were dirty.

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:03.920
Geez... Why can't you get your act together?

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:07.190
If you can't, it all becomes my responsibility.

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:08.990
Yes, ma'am...

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:11.460
Is something wrong?

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.490
I thought I heard a noise.

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:17.070
Really?

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:23.170
Well, I'll be going now.

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:26.240
Make sure you come to work tomorrow.

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:28.050
Yes, ma'am...

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:11.450
Good morning.

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:15.090
Excuse me, let me leave this here.

00:07:15.430 --> 00:07:16.520
No problem.

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:19.040
Oh, that's for your vespa.

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:19.900
Yes.

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:23.960
Would you like me to take it over later?

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:26.310
Miss Robin?

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:27.840
I'm gonna borrow this!

00:07:29.180 --> 00:07:30.270
Sure...

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:34.750
That's amazing, you actually look bored.

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:36.320
What, Sakaki?

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:38.840
If you have something to say, you should come right out and say it.

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:41.220
No, it's nothing.

00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:42.750
It's just an accident.

00:07:43.390 --> 00:07:46.450
The police wrapped up their investigation of the scene yesterday.

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:48.900
Can you dig around a little more?

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:51.500
What is it? Something happen?

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:52.630
No, it's just that...

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.800
Is it some sort of incident, Robin?

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:58.570
N-No, it's nothing at all.

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:02.940
Amon, I want to go pick up my bike.

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:05.540
H-Hey!

00:08:10.890 --> 00:08:12.910
This isn't going to happen again, understand?

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:16.530
If you think I'm your chauffeur, you're...

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:18.390
Do you think we could take a detour?

00:08:18.860 --> 00:08:19.950
What?

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:26.870
What in the world is this about?

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:29.460
What's the big idea, calling me out on a personal call like this?

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:30.910
I'm sorry.

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:33.430
I was up all night working, and haven't slept at all...

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:36.110
Investigating accidents isn't our job.

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:37.210
I know that.

00:08:37.210 --> 00:08:38.480
Why are we here, then?

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:40.950
I thought this would be better than touching a corpse.

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:42.920
That's not what I'm asking.

00:08:42.920 --> 00:08:46.380
I saw her right before she died.

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:51.190
Thanks to her, I was able to stay dry during the storm.

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:54.000
That was all I knew about her,

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:58.370
...but at the very least, I want people to know what happened in the last moments of her life.

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:03.010
No... I want to know.

00:09:03.010 --> 00:09:06.570
I'm not here just to satisfy your curiosity.

00:09:06.840 --> 00:09:09.150
Our job is to hunt Witches!

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:11.180
We don't need to poke our noses into accidents involving normal...

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:12.700
Don't get so worked up.

00:09:13.120 --> 00:09:16.350
Children are selfish by nature. She'll be satisfied if you go through with it.

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:25.820
Getting anything?

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:28.190
I'm sensing tremendous surprise.

00:09:29.030 --> 00:09:30.870
I'm not sure exactly why.

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:32.200
What was she surprised by?

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:33.630
I just said that I don't know!

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:36.200
Probably by a cat jumping out into the street or something.

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:37.700
That's impossible.

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:40.740
There are no skid marks.

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:43.800
If something had jumped out, she would have reacted by slamming on her brakes.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.550
I'm also curious about the wound on her neck.

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:48.020
Maybe she wasn't watching the road.

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:51.510
If you're thrown through a windshield, a wound like that isn't too unusual.

00:09:52.090 --> 00:09:54.390
It's certainly true that humans die easily.

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:57.430
Amon!

00:09:57.430 --> 00:09:59.890
I want to see the girl that Miss Eiko said she was on her way to visit.

00:10:01.230 --> 00:10:02.700
Keep her company until she's satisfied.

00:10:03.270 --> 00:10:06.960
I'm going home. Hang in there, Amon.

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:15.710
I had no idea you could be this aggressive.

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:22.450
Yes?

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:25.720
For her sister, you don't look very much alike.

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:28.260
She was going to be my sister.

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:32.590
He's Miss Eiko's boyfriend, and I'm his sister.

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:37.600
My brother has been in shock ever since she passed away.

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:43.270
Did Miss Eiko say anything unusual to you last night?

00:10:44.670 --> 00:10:46.510
Did she have any enemies?

00:10:46.510 --> 00:10:49.530
I don't think so. For starters, Miss Eiko is really pretty,

00:10:50.310 --> 00:10:52.280
...and she's good at her job.

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:54.420
Aren't you sad about it?

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:56.390
Huh? Why?

00:10:56.390 --> 00:10:58.650
Well, because she was your boss.

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:07.960
Oh, I have to go to work.

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:10.930
Miss Eiko scolded me last night.

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:12.160
- Um...
- Let's go.

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:13.530
Sorry we bothered you.

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:19.110
Satisfied now?

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:22.650
Why are you so obsessed with this?

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:24.640
That girl... She's strange.

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:28.480
She had an alibi.

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:31.450
The landlord saw her see Miss Eiko off from her apartment.

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:33.080
That may be true, but...

00:11:33.990 --> 00:11:36.320
She really is strange.

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:41.820
I can go pick up your bike for you right now.

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:44.690
I forgot the fuel tank.

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:49.310
Oh, Miss Robin?

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:53.040
Michael asked me to tell you to come to the office when you got back.

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:54.470
Michael?

00:11:55.880 --> 00:11:57.580
I found out quite a bit, Robin.

00:11:57.580 --> 00:11:59.920
Won't it look suspicious for us all to be out of the office?

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:00.850
Oh, it'll be fine!

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:03.780
The girl Chie that you guys just met...

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:07.090
We shouldn't be doing this. This is personal...

00:12:07.090 --> 00:12:10.650
Given a choice between orders and curiosity, I'll choose curiosity.

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:14.260
What's this?

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:16.090
A CT scan of her brain.

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:19.870
She was hospitalized once because of a concussion,

00:12:19.870 --> 00:12:21.700
...and this was taken at that time.

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:23.660
See, look over here.

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:26.170
This part of her brain is all fragmented.

00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:28.740
Is that area supposed to be connected?

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:31.480
Yup. Having that area all fragmented like this...

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:34.610
...is a typical symptom of multiple personality disorder.

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:37.910
But there hasn't been a single report of her displaying other personalities.

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:41.550
In other words, she has no problems in her day-to-day life?

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:43.330
That's the long and short of it.

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:44.720
Why don't we quit while we're ahead?

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:46.790
This person hasn't done anything, and look at how we're treating her.

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:49.730
She's a Witch.

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:52.900
What makes you so sure? How can you explain it?

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:56.600
I can't explain it...

00:12:56.770 --> 00:13:02.640
It's a dangerous idea to say that every person that has strange things going on is a Witch!

00:13:03.310 --> 00:13:05.710
We'll be in big trouble if we have another false alarm!

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:11.050
Robin, you're just itching for a chance to use your powers!

00:13:12.050 --> 00:13:14.390
Aren't there times when YOU want to use your powers, Karasuma?!

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:18.720
I noticed that everyone was missing, and where do I find you sneaking around...?

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:23.260
Digging through personal information with no grounds whatsoever...

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:26.430
Even for the STN, this is abuse of power!

00:13:26.900 --> 00:13:30.100
Amon, you of all people should know that!

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:34.910
Who started all this?

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:35.880
I did.

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:38.340
I asked them to.

00:13:38.650 --> 00:13:39.610
Robin...!

00:13:40.150 --> 00:13:43.210
Since you just got assigned here, you must be tired.

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:45.750
You can go home for today and rest up.

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:46.520
But l...

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:47.490
Robin.

00:13:48.690 --> 00:13:50.350
Do as you're told.

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:53.920
All right, playtime's over! Break it up!

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:57.520
Aw, just when I was finally having a little fun...

00:13:57.900 --> 00:13:59.960
It's unusual to see you show an interest in work.

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:01.570
Seeing me in a better light?

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:02.800
Not hardly.

00:14:06.040 --> 00:14:08.710
On her family tree, how many degrees of kinship did you look up?

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:10.140
Out to the third.

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:12.510
Check it out to the sixth degree.

00:14:12.510 --> 00:14:14.180
But that's an abuse of power...

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:17.280
Orders or curiosity. Which will it be?

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:21.420
If you hit the jackpot, I'll show you a website that'll knock your socks off.

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:23.150
Okay, I'll do it!

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:28.860
What are you doing?

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:32.320
Measuring the oil. These scooters use mixed fuel.

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:34.530
Sounds like a lot of work.

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:40.370
Well, I'll go on ahead. Please be careful on your way back.

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:41.710
Sure.

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:49.750
I'd better hurry...

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:02.290
Here, use this.

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:05.570
It's certainly true that humans die easily.

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:10.230
Geez, kids nowadays...

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:14.610
Huh? Why?

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:19.600
You're just itching for a chance to use your powers!

00:15:32.230 --> 00:15:34.530
I found a Witch among her distant relatives.

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:35.360
Really?

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:37.820
But I found out something even more interesting.

00:15:38.270 --> 00:15:41.170
Three years ago, her boyfriend died in a very strange way.

00:15:41.800 --> 00:15:44.600
He died from blood loss when his Achilles' tendon and an artery were cut.

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:46.440
That's an odd way to die.

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:49.640
That guy was quite a player, it looks like.

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:52.410
That Chie girl might have just been a fling.

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:53.850
Was she a suspect?

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:57.440
No. She had a solid alibi for that case, too.

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:03.060
Thanks for all the trouble.

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:05.750
Amon, how about that killer website?

00:16:05.990 --> 00:16:07.330
Oh, that?

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:09.960
I'll let you know when you're an adult.

00:16:10.370 --> 00:16:11.530
Aw, man...

00:16:37.130 --> 00:16:38.290
Is that it?

00:16:58.410 --> 00:16:59.400
I'm sorry.

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:02.250
Don't use those powers in this house ever again.

00:17:02.990 --> 00:17:05.550
It may be nothing to you, but...

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:15.860
Black, right?

00:17:16.530 --> 00:17:18.190
I guess it means you're still young.

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:23.800
Hey, have you heard of the Law of Conservation of Matter?

00:17:25.170 --> 00:17:27.240
When water boils, it decreases in quantity.

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:30.580
But all it does is turn into water vapor and hide in the air.

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:32.910
Human emotions are like that, as well.

00:17:33.550 --> 00:17:36.110
Emotions that you gloss over are hiding somewhere.

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:39.080
They never, ever disappear.

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:40.820
That's the truth.

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:44.520
I'll try to have more faith in what I think.

00:17:47.300 --> 00:17:48.960
That was a waste of time.

00:17:50.600 --> 00:17:51.330
He'll pay!

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:53.560
We'll make him pay!

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:54.600
He'll pay!

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:57.260
We'll make him pay...

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:06.720
Hello, Resource Management Center.

00:18:06.720 --> 00:18:09.510
Chie, we have a huge problem! That guy came by again.

00:18:10.390 --> 00:18:14.450
The guy who said he was her boyfriend. He was here, sniffing around our secret.

00:18:15.220 --> 00:18:16.730
I've taken steps for now.

00:18:16.730 --> 00:18:18.730
But I'm still worried, so hurry home!

00:18:18.730 --> 00:18:19.850
All right.

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:30.370
You'll pay!

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:51.250
I see...

00:18:52.430 --> 00:18:54.190
So that's what happened.

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:06.510
Hello?

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:27.960
We won't let anyone stick their noses into our secret!

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:29.490
No one!

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:30.930
You'll pay!

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:32.390
We won't let anyone!

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:40.400
Jeanne!

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:42.770
Jeanne!

00:19:43.610 --> 00:19:45.050
Chie, kill her!

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:46.710
Avenge Jeanne!

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:48.510
We can't let her leave alive!

00:19:49.990 --> 00:19:51.680
Come on, let's kill her!

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:54.620
Chie!

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:55.920
Chie!

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:56.820
Hurry!

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:00.590
Robin!

00:20:00.930 --> 00:20:03.400
Set the dolls on fire! They're part of the Witch, too!

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:17.010
Guys...

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:18.980
Wait!

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:21.610
Forget it. It's too late.

00:20:27.690 --> 00:20:33.990
45, 46, 47, 48, 49...

00:20:34.930 --> 00:20:38.870
According to Amon's report, there were fifty dolls in total.

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:40.890
So where's the last one?

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:43.740
Maybe it's still running around somewhere!

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:46.100
But the Witch herself has died, right?

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:49.600
That's true. It couldn't possibly be doing that.

00:20:51.380 --> 00:20:52.570
A job well done.

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:54.950
No...

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:56.610
Don't be so modest.

00:20:57.120 --> 00:20:58.550
It's not that.

00:20:59.790 --> 00:21:06.520
It's sad for someone you know to die. I just wanted to take my mind off of it.

00:21:07.630 --> 00:21:11.030
But she was different. It didn't bother her at all.

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:12.590
That was...

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:17.340
I wanted to believe that someone passing away was something...

00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:20.800
...that would always move someone emotionally, no matter what.

00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:38.250
You can return it whenever.

00:21:39.730 --> 00:21:42.990
I'm sorry I couldn't return it to you properly...

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:05.820
Touko...

00:22:36.720 --> 00:22:44.710
Just how far back do I need to go?

00:22:44.530 --> 00:22:47.570
Tell me.

00:22:48.780 --> 00:22:59.560
It's all so vivid that it hurts.

00:23:00.420 --> 00:23:09.450
The truth is, nothing can be shared,

00:23:09.130 --> 00:23:13.940
...so I never looked back.

00:23:15.210 --> 00:23:19.310
...all those promises...

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:25.710
...inside me eventually...

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:31.510
...gave up on that light from some other time,

00:23:30.710 --> 00:23:40.290
...like the light of a morning you can't return to.
